    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1hvb8g4">
      <bpmn:text>All data from student, examination, and fee management must be evaluable and retrievable by the University of Ulm for certificates. Authorizations for individual certificates are granted (e.g. academic advising, Dept. II – International Office, etc.).

All certificates must be verifiable (exact content!).</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
